        'rawContent': "---\r\ntitle: \"Operation_Lawless\"\r\npage_id: 3702\r\nnamespace: 0\r\nnamespace_name: \"Main\"\r\nlatest_revision_id: 11744\r\nlast_updated: \"2009-05-17 19:09:34\"\r\nauthor: \"JDavis\"\r\nis_redirect: false\r\ncategories:\r\n  - \"Second_Exodus_War\"\r\ntemplates:\r\n  - \"Military_Operation_Information\"\r\n  - \"Second_Exodus_War_Navbox\"\r\n---\r\n\r\n{{Military Operation Information|\r\n|name =Operation Lawless\r\n|operation_theater = [[Sirius Cluster]]\r\n|executor =[[Onyx Empire]]\r\n|planner =[[Victor Pryce]]\r\n|timeframe =[[2319]]\r\n}}\r\n\r\n'''Operation Lawless''' was the official [[Military of the Onyx Empire|Onyx Military]] designation for the invasion of the [[Sirius Cluster]].  It is more commonly referred to as the [[Sirius Incursion]].\r\n\r\n<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n{{Second Exodus War Navbox}}\r\n[[Category:Second Exodus War]]"
