        'categories': [
            'Volucris_War'
        ],
        'rawContent': "---\r\ntitle: \"Korval_Line\"\r\npage_id: 4132\r\nnamespace: 0\r\nnamespace_name: \"Main\"\r\nlatest_revision_id: 11492\r\nlast_updated: \"2009-05-11 03:08:19\"\r\nauthor: \"JDavis\"\r\nis_redirect: false\r\ncategories:\r\n  - \"Volucris_War\"\r\ntemplates: []\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe '''Korval Line''' was an enormous defensive perimeter that was established to protect the Zaur Peninsula on [[Lorithan]].  It was named for Urta Resun Salir Korval, who was in operational command of [[Rikaz Jael]] for three months in [[2333]].\r\n\r\n[[Category:Volucris War]]"
