        'summary': 'Core terminology and historical concepts marking significant milestones across galactic history.',
        'rawContent': "This category covers a number of '''historical terms''', which are titles for various events in different parts of [[:Category:History|history]].\n\n== Key Historical Concepts ==\n* [[First Contact]] - The initial momentous meetings between different intelligent species in the galaxy, notably between the Terrans and the Meroniri.\n* [[Diaspora]] - The scattering of humanity and other intelligent races across disparate star sectors following ancient and modern exoduses.\n\n[[Category:History]]"
