        'lastUpdated': '2009-05-13 20:49:59',
        'categories': [
            'History',
            'Volucris_War',
            'Categories'
        ],
        'summary': 'Consolidated memoirs, personal journals, and official logs written during the catastrophic Volucris invasion of the Mirdek System.',
        'rawContent': "In the period immediately following the [[Volucris War]], [[Siovar Cai]] insisted that as many accounts of the war be documented, and as much history preserved as possible. Even as the last ships fled the [[Mirdek System]], journals, diaries, and official logs were consolidated together. In [[2336]], these were published together in the ''Voices from Lorithan'' collection.\n\n== Published Chronicles & Accounts ==\n* [[Letters from Sasha Brrvil]] - Personal wartime correspondence from a civilian caught in the collapse of the planet's defenses.\n* [[Saving Sasha: Failsafe]] - Tactical rescue operation account detailing attempts to extract civilians ahead of the swarms.\n* [[Bugshock]] - Harrowing psychological study and combat account of soldiers facing the relentless bio-mechanical swarms.\n\n[[Category:History]]\n[[Category:Volucris War]]"
